      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">Below is a **moving cost analysis** that breaks down every element of the final bill. The description is kept in a table‑like format inside the paragraph for quick reference, while still flowing naturally as a narrative.

> **Cost Breakdown (per 500 ft² residential move)**  
> | Item | Description | Cost |  
> |------|-------------|------|  
> | Base Fare | Flat fee for loading, unloading, and 1‑hour on‑site service | $350 |  
