    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Belgaum to Bangalore | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my bike protected from scratches during the Belgaum to Bangalore transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad uses a dedicated covered container truck equipped with a hydraulic ramp and a 7‑layer protective wrap that includes stretch film, high‑density foam, bubble wrap, and custom wooden crates. Each layer is designed to absorb shocks and prevent contact with the truck interior, ensuring a zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for bike transport from Belgaum to Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid bike registration certificate, a government‑issued ID, and a signed e‑Way bill. Our team also prepares an IBA‑approved invoice that can be used for corporate or government reimbursement claims, streamlining the paperwork for a hassle‑free move.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for my two‑wheeler shipment on the Belgaum‑Bangalore route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While insurance is optional, we strongly recommend the IRDAI‑approved full‑value transit insurance. It covers any accidental damage or loss up to the declared value of your bike, giving you peace of mind throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long will it take for my bike to reach Bangalore after pickup in Belgaum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our express service guarantees pickup within 24 hours of booking, transit completion in 48 hours, and delivery to the destination address within 72 hours. Real‑time GPS tracking lets you monitor progress at every stage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike’s location while it’s being transported?</h3>
